        "day_number": 11,
        "title": "Chapter IV The Prophet of the Highest (3)",
        "content": "<p>And when we read the words of the apostle Paul about John \"fulfilling his course,\" we may well ask for grace that we may fill up to the brim the measure of our opportunities, that we may realize to the full God's meaning and intention in creating us: and so our lives shall mate with the Divine Ideal, like sublime words with some heavenly strain, each completing the other.</p>",
        "references": [
          "Hebrews 1:1",
          "Psalms 74:9",
